{% doc %}
  @prompt
    LEFT SIDE CONTENT (Text + Button Column)
    
    Left Column Layout:
    
    Align everything to the left.
    
    Add generous white space and large top/bottom padding.
    
    Keep the background pure white.
    
    Headline:
    
    Large, bold two-line headline:
    
    Line 1: “We Got Tired of”
    
    Line 2: “Metals and Pedals.”
    
    Main color: dark navy blue (#002B5B).
    
    Keep the lines stacked exactly as shown.
    
    Subtext Paragraph:
    
    Short paragraph in medium gray (#555):
    
    “Royal Bin™ was made to outperform… and outclass. From design to daily use, it’s a smart home essential disguised as a trash can.”
    
    Body text should be slightly smaller and softer.
    
    Button:
    
    Add a CTA button under the text:
    
    Text: “Shop Now”
    
    Background: deep navy (#032B5B)
    
    Text: white
    
    Fully rounded/pill-shaped (border-radius: 9999px)
    
    Button height should be tall and premium-looking.
    
    Align left.
    
    RIGHT SIDE CONTENT (Comparison Chart)
    
    Right Column Layout:
    
    Create a three-product comparison table:
    
    Royal Bin™
    
    Old Trash Bins
    
    Other “Smart” Bins
    
    Use a layout where the product photos appear at the top and feature checklist rows appear beneath.
    
    Top Section (Images + Labels):
    
    Display three product images horizontally aligned:
    
    Royal Bin image FIRST, inside a thin blue rectangular frame (matching screenshot)
    
    Old Trash Bins image SECOND
    
    Other “Smart” Bins image THIRD
    
    Below each image, include the label text:
    
    “Royal Bin™” in navy blue bold text.
    
    “Old Trash Bins”
    
    “Other “Smart” Bins”
    
    Comparison Rows:
    Create a list of features on the left, with check/cross/dash icons for each product column. Each row must be separated by thin light gray horizontal lines.
    
    Feature Row Labels (left column):
    
    SELF-SEALING
    
    AUTO-BAG RELOAD
    
    MODERN DESIGN
    
    ODOR-CONTROL
    
    TOUCH-FREE LID OPEN
    
    SMART RING SYSTEM
    
    LEAK-PROOF
    
    OVERFILL PROTECTION
    
    (Continue adding rows exactly like screenshot if more appear.)
    
    Icons:
    
    Royal Bin™ column uses green checkmarks.
    
